          "viewing_task": "<ol><li><strong>[00:45] Recall:</strong> In which Egyptian city and on what date did President Gamal Abdel Nasser publicly announce the nationalisation of the Suez Canal?</li><li><strong>[01:50] Explain:</strong> Explain why British Prime Minister Anthony Eden viewed Nasser's nationalisation not merely as a commercial dispute, but as an existential threat to British imperial prestige and Middle Eastern oil supplies.</li><li><strong>[02:40] Challenge:</strong> Analyze how Eden's personal experience of 1930s European appeasement led him to fatally misjudge President Nasser as an 'Egyptian Hitler' who had to be overthrown.</li></ol>",
