              "hinge_question": "How did the US emergency airlift (Operation Nickel Grass) enable Israel to execute this massive counter-offensive?",
              "source_context": "In the first week of combat, Israel burned through half its tank inventory and immense ammunition stocks. President Richard Nixon ordered Operation Nickel Grass, flying 22,000 tons of tanks, artillery, and anti-tank missiles on giant C-5 Galaxy transports directly to Lod airport. This massive replenishment gave Israel the hardware needed to bridge the canal. Hinge Question: How did the US emergency airlift (Operation Nickel Grass) enable Israel to execute this massive counter-offensive?",
